// REFACTOR:grounded (#320, plan585): explicit age publication replaces legacy age authoring and lowering; unrelated contracts are retained.
# standalone-age
library "Standalone Age".

// #257 (age slice) T1 — a local-coded concept forces the INTERFACE split (this library gets
// layered), and a STANDALONE Patient age posrep (no local `code is` override) must be classifiable
// in this lane — it rides the Inferred layer as a computed determination, NOT dropped to a null
// layer. Pre-migration the equivalent `definition is age today` classified Inferred here; the
// migrated posrep form must not regress.

concept "Has Local Thing":
- type is Observation.
- value type is boolean.
- code is `thing`.

concept "Adult":
- shape is Record.
- type is Observation.
- value type is boolean.
- shape reduction is most recent.
- source representation:
  - type is Patient.
  - value projection is age today at least 18 years.

decision "Eligibility":
first:
- when "Adult" then recommend activity "certify.Approve".
- otherwise then recommend activity "not-certify.Deny".

activity "certify.Approve":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `Adult — approve.`.
activity "not-certify.Deny":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `Not an adult — deny.`.
